WEBVTT

00:00:02.022 --> 00:00:05.890
The beginning breeze

00:00:06.293 --> 00:00:10.161
Delivers this message

00:00:10.598 --> 00:00:19.165
"Because I have always believed in you"

00:00:20.307 --> 00:00:20.774
The Story of Saiunkoku

00:00:20.774 --> 00:00:28.883
The Story of Saiunkoku
We are standing in the land
we dreamed of back then

00:00:28.883 --> 00:00:29.178
The Story of Saiunkoku

00:00:29.416 --> 00:00:36.686
We feel weak at the knees a little,
gazing over the scenery

00:00:36.924 --> 00:00:41.054
But please don't look back

00:00:41.195 --> 00:00:45.222
Because you've decided to go forward

00:00:45.432 --> 00:00:49.528
I looked up into the sky to see
the rainbow with seven colors

00:00:49.803 --> 00:00:53.239
Can you see it too?

00:00:53.507 --> 00:00:57.409
The beginning breeze

00:00:57.811 --> 00:01:01.406
Delivers this message

00:01:01.849 --> 00:01:10.086
I will watch over you as
you go forth to chase your dreams

00:01:10.457 --> 00:01:18.660
The dancing winds in the blazing sun

00:01:19.099 --> 00:01:28.770
Fly forth strongly
with the wings of freedom

00:01:32.346 --> 00:01:35.110
During the palace celebration,
Shurei had boldly presented the plan...

00:01:35.182 --> 00:01:37.173
...to make Sa Province a
center of academic research.

00:01:37.251 --> 00:01:41.210
News of her success had
reached Eigetsu and the others.

00:01:41.889 --> 00:01:43.117
Way to go, Princess!

00:01:43.190 --> 00:01:46.250
She's taken a firm first step to
making your plan come true!

00:01:46.894 --> 00:01:50.557
For them to consider such a large-
scale and outrageous plan like that...!

00:01:51.165 --> 00:01:53.998
This is Governor Hong's
and your plan, isn't it?

00:01:54.602 --> 00:01:56.467
Well, that's true, but...!

00:01:56.537 --> 00:02:00.371
It will be a long journey, but I'll also
help out to the best of my abilities.

00:02:03.777 --> 00:02:06.245
- All right, let's do it!
- Right!

00:02:10.017 --> 00:02:13.748
However the person who received the
biggest shock from the plan was...!

00:02:16.290 --> 00:02:21.250
Fate is a Mysterious
yet Fascinating Thing

00:02:21.362 --> 00:02:23.296
Phew! It's over!

00:02:23.364 --> 00:02:25.594
I've been hearing and giving New
Year greetings for seven days now...

00:02:25.666 --> 00:02:27.896
...over and over again,
from dawn until dusk!

00:02:28.269 --> 00:02:30.237
I'm thoroughly exhausted!

00:02:30.604 --> 00:02:32.299
Your Majesty... we were thinking...

00:02:32.373 --> 00:02:35.206
Perhaps we should all pay a visit
to Shoka's residence tonight.

00:02:38.112 --> 00:02:40.137
No. Unfortunately,
I'll have to pass.

00:02:41.582 --> 00:02:43.675
I must look over the New
Year greeting letters...

00:02:43.751 --> 00:02:46.219
...and write replies to
those that require them.

00:02:46.720 --> 00:02:47.550
Oh.

00:02:51.625 --> 00:02:52.887
I assumed he would
come and see Shurei...

00:02:52.960 --> 00:02:55.053
...the moment he had the
opportunity, but...!

00:02:55.496 --> 00:02:57.327
That's royal spirit for you.

00:02:57.831 --> 00:03:01.460
But, I was kinda hoping for him to say
and do things somewhat differently.

00:03:02.503 --> 00:03:04.471
Same goes for you too, right?

00:03:07.174 --> 00:03:09.972
- So, she's not here?
- No.

00:03:10.044 --> 00:03:13.138
Right now, she and Yushun are
running about here and there.

00:03:13.614 --> 00:03:15.138
Is that so?

00:03:15.215 --> 00:03:18.548
Well, it's not as though Shurei's
purpose here is to return home, right?

00:03:20.254 --> 00:03:24.020
I... suppose not. I'm terribly
sorry for our thoughtlessness.

00:03:24.458 --> 00:03:26.551
We'll forward a letter first next time.

00:03:27.494 --> 00:03:29.928
Shurei really wanted to meet
up with the two of you, too.

00:03:30.597 --> 00:03:31.564
She was saying she'd like to...

00:03:31.632 --> 00:03:34.396
...invite you here once things
have settled down a bit.

00:03:35.836 --> 00:03:38.270
Really... She's matured so much.

00:03:39.907 --> 00:03:44.003
She said she didn't want you to
think she had come home to play.

00:03:45.713 --> 00:03:48.181
And even if you didn't think so, she
said you wouldn't acknowledge her...

00:03:48.248 --> 00:03:50.216
...unless she worked hard
enough for two.

00:03:51.985 --> 00:03:54.977
Shurei really is an admirable,
hard-working young lady.

00:03:56.256 --> 00:03:58.224
Could you please give this to Shurei?

00:03:58.292 --> 00:04:00.260
Thank you very much for your gift.

00:04:00.561 --> 00:04:01.528
Goodbye.

00:04:02.229 --> 00:04:03.389
We'll visit again.

00:04:04.398 --> 00:04:06.366
I'll be expecting you.

00:04:06.533 --> 00:04:07.329
Oh!

00:04:08.435 --> 00:04:11.461
Speaking of which, has His
Majesty been in touch with you?

00:04:11.905 --> 00:04:14.601
- No, not once.
- Is that right?

00:04:16.243 --> 00:04:17.972
- Is something wrong?
- No.

00:04:18.045 --> 00:04:20.513
It's just that His Majesty
hasn't stopped working.

00:04:20.681 --> 00:04:23.479
Even though Shurei has returned, he
hasn't even attempted to meet with her.

00:04:26.320 --> 00:04:28.413
Lord Koyu. General Ran.

00:04:29.022 --> 00:04:29.545
What is it?

00:04:30.224 --> 00:04:32.692
Do you remember what His
Majesty's real name is?

00:04:34.928 --> 00:04:37.396
It's King Ryuki Shi.

00:04:57.351 --> 00:04:59.114
In the end, since returning
I've only met...

00:04:59.186 --> 00:05:01.654
...with him face-to-face that once,
during the palace celebration.

00:05:03.290 --> 00:05:05.884
- Why don't we call it a day?
- Ah, no.

00:05:06.360 --> 00:05:07.327
I want to continue checking into...

00:05:07.394 --> 00:05:09.658
...royal council research
institutions a bit longer.

00:05:10.097 --> 00:05:14.033
Oh... but you mustn't leave
Miss Rin Sai alone any longer.

00:05:14.568 --> 00:05:17.036
Don't worry. She has her own
business to take care of.

00:05:17.704 --> 00:05:19.001
For starters, she's
hosting a reception for...

00:05:19.072 --> 00:05:20.630
...merchants from all the
provinces tonight.

00:05:21.041 --> 00:05:23.168
A reception? Where is it being held?

00:05:23.911 --> 00:05:25.902
I think it's a place called Kogaro.

00:05:28.549 --> 00:05:30.517
Then we'll go there too!

00:05:36.657 --> 00:05:39.023
Kogaro

00:05:39.693 --> 00:05:41.661
Please wait here for a moment.

00:05:43.130 --> 00:05:47.157
I worked here from time to time
before I became a government official...

00:05:47.334 --> 00:05:47.734
Kogaro

00:05:47.734 --> 00:05:50.237
Kogaro
...keeping accounts,
doing maid services, and such.

00:05:50.237 --> 00:05:50.532
Kogaro

00:05:51.338 --> 00:05:55.138
- You worked here?
- Yes. And it helped me greatly.

00:06:01.715 --> 00:06:03.683
- My dear Shurei!
- Whoa!

00:06:06.553 --> 00:06:09.989
Welcome back, my dear Shurei. You've
truly become an impressive woman.

00:06:12.326 --> 00:06:14.294
Miss Kocho.

00:06:19.633 --> 00:06:21.498
Please kindly excuse us.

00:06:23.804 --> 00:06:26.204
I am Shurei Hong,
Governor of Sa Province.

00:06:27.007 --> 00:06:29.441
This is Yushun Tei,
the Lieutenant Governor.

00:06:33.447 --> 00:06:35.347
It's a pleasure to have you here.

00:06:35.415 --> 00:06:39.647
Please kindly allow all of us at Kogaro
to give you a warm reception tonight.

00:06:46.994 --> 00:06:48.518
Governor Hong.

00:07:00.407 --> 00:07:02.398
Did you have a good time?

00:07:02.609 --> 00:07:04.236
Yes, very much so.

00:07:04.311 --> 00:07:07.041
Miss Kocho. Thank you
so very much.

00:07:07.581 --> 00:07:09.845
Don't mention it. I'd do anything
for you, my dear Shurei.

00:07:10.517 --> 00:07:13.953
You're our pride as
well as our dream.

00:07:18.191 --> 00:07:20.159
In any case,
I'm surprised to learn...

00:07:20.227 --> 00:07:22.695
...that the leader of the
Merchants Guild for Sa Province...

00:07:22.763 --> 00:07:24.628
...is a beautiful woman like you.

00:07:24.698 --> 00:07:27.166
But my term of office
has reached its end.

00:07:27.501 --> 00:07:28.763
Really?

00:07:28.835 --> 00:07:30.132
It's one thing that can't be helped.

00:07:30.203 --> 00:07:32.433
But I've done everything
I could in the meantime.

00:07:33.874 --> 00:07:37.605
When we were little children,
the Sai Clan was truly poor.

00:07:39.613 --> 00:07:43.344
As the Sa Clan became stronger
the Sai Clan fell in proportion.

00:07:44.518 --> 00:07:49.285
It's because of that, that Sho
and I decided to become merchants.

00:07:49.957 --> 00:07:52.323
With the meritocratic Merchants
Guild, we would not have to bow to...

00:07:52.392 --> 00:07:54.826
...Sa Clan pressure, so we'd have the
opportunity to build on our strength.

00:07:55.929 --> 00:07:58.727
Also, although few, the doors usually
closed to women were open here.

00:08:00.968 --> 00:08:03.994
This sounds a lot like the path
that my dear Shurei walked.

00:08:04.938 --> 00:08:05.495
Not really.

00:08:05.572 --> 00:08:07.836
What I've done can't compare to what
Governor Hong has accomplished.

00:08:08.709 --> 00:08:10.939
The depth of the heartfelt feelings
you and Governor To have...

00:08:11.011 --> 00:08:12.911
...has saved Sa Province.

00:08:13.981 --> 00:08:16.506
You've accomplished things
that we couldn't do.

00:08:20.253 --> 00:08:23.848
F-From now on, Miss Rin, will you
be committed to raising a family?

00:08:24.057 --> 00:08:26.025
No, I'll devote myself to
being an inventor.

00:08:26.493 --> 00:08:27.391
An inventor?!

00:08:27.461 --> 00:08:29.759
I entered the Merchants
Guild in the first place...

00:08:29.830 --> 00:08:31.798
...because I was praised
for my inventions.

00:08:31.865 --> 00:08:34.333
I'm thinking that, in the future,
I'd like to invent things...

00:08:34.401 --> 00:08:36.869
...that will benefit the lives of
people who can't move freely.

00:08:38.972 --> 00:08:41.440
If my dear husband can maintain the
fine balance between his commitment...

00:08:41.508 --> 00:08:43.976
...to work and his love for his wife,
then I should be able to do it too.

00:08:49.082 --> 00:08:51.107
Balance of work and love?

00:08:53.720 --> 00:08:54.482
I'm home!

00:08:54.554 --> 00:08:56.681
Welcome back!
You're here just in time.

00:08:59.593 --> 00:09:01.652
I just brewed some tea.

00:09:02.929 --> 00:09:04.897
The tea father brews...!

00:09:11.004 --> 00:09:12.528
So bitter!

00:09:12.606 --> 00:09:15.074
No, I'm so relieved that
the flavor hasn't changed!

00:09:15.208 --> 00:09:17.039
I'm glad to hear that.

00:09:17.377 --> 00:09:19.345
Huh? Where's Seiran?

00:09:19.413 --> 00:09:21.677
- He's gone out.
- Is that so?

00:09:22.249 --> 00:09:25.548
Speaking of which, Lord Koyu and
General Ran came here today.

00:09:26.053 --> 00:09:28.521
They brought along lots
of food ingredients.

00:09:31.725 --> 00:09:33.317
Father.

00:09:33.627 --> 00:09:36.755
Come to think of it, I haven't
properly said, "I'm home."

00:09:37.597 --> 00:09:40.327
Not to the people who took care
of me nor even to you, Father.

00:09:41.401 --> 00:09:43.369
I was only able to get this far...

00:09:43.837 --> 00:09:46.305
...because of the people who
supported me along the way. Yet I...!

00:09:47.307 --> 00:09:49.275
That's all right.

00:09:51.945 --> 00:09:54.914
Maybe I can invite everyone here and
cook a meal for them like I used to.

00:09:58.685 --> 00:10:00.653
And so...

00:10:02.522 --> 00:10:04.490
I'm home, Father.

00:10:08.562 --> 00:10:10.427
Welcome home.

00:10:27.114 --> 00:10:30.174
It's been a while Elder Brother.
I'm glad to see you're well.

00:10:31.918 --> 00:10:34.386
I didn't think I could bring
myself to see you face-to-face.

00:10:35.455 --> 00:10:37.650
I had every intention of protecting
her even in exchange for my life.

00:10:39.392 --> 00:10:41.553
Shurei has come back
safe and sound.

00:10:42.295 --> 00:10:44.263
On her own strength.

00:10:44.431 --> 00:10:46.899
I planned to protect her, but before I
knew it, I was the one being protected.

00:10:47.634 --> 00:10:49.659
I'm irritated at my own worthlessness.

00:10:51.204 --> 00:10:54.002
Even still... I envy you, Brother.

00:10:56.143 --> 00:10:58.873
Because I can't even have a
reason like yours to be irritated.

00:11:07.020 --> 00:11:11.980
The Story of Saiunkoku

00:11:20.667 --> 00:11:21.395
Seiran.

00:11:22.402 --> 00:11:24.836
- Good morning.
- G-Good morning to you too.

00:11:25.238 --> 00:11:27.206
So, come on and join me!

00:11:27.674 --> 00:11:29.642
M-My lady!

00:11:33.013 --> 00:11:34.981
I'm home, Mother.

00:11:37.150 --> 00:11:38.617
- Seiran.
- Yes?

00:11:39.553 --> 00:11:43.683
This is still our home town,
and the place to come home to.

00:11:45.592 --> 00:11:48.493
That's why we mustn't forget it,
no matter where we are.

00:11:49.362 --> 00:11:52.331
I thought to myself, since I was to
become the governor of Sa Province...

00:11:52.399 --> 00:11:54.959
...I should try not to think
of my home town too often.

00:11:56.102 --> 00:11:58.263
But this is where my
dream first started.

00:12:01.875 --> 00:12:04.810
Thank you for having
supported my dream so far.

00:12:05.579 --> 00:12:08.047
And please continue
supporting me from now on.

00:12:09.282 --> 00:12:12.080
All right, I'm gonna prepare a feast
tonight. The first time in a while!

00:12:12.552 --> 00:12:14.520
Seiran, you'll be helping!

00:12:35.876 --> 00:12:37.343
Master.

00:12:39.746 --> 00:12:44.046
You know, seeing you two working
is really making me emotional.

00:12:45.085 --> 00:12:47.417
It's like, "Ah, the two have
come home."

00:12:52.893 --> 00:12:54.360
Master.

00:12:55.996 --> 00:12:58.464
It's kind of late for saying
this now, but let me say it.

00:12:58.698 --> 00:13:00.666
I have now returned to my home.

00:13:01.902 --> 00:13:04.097
Right now, I'm also
feeling quite emotional.

00:13:04.170 --> 00:13:06.604
For the overwhelming happiness
to have a place to come home to.

00:13:07.374 --> 00:13:09.342
It reminds me that I am not alone.

00:13:10.877 --> 00:13:12.845
But...!

00:13:22.889 --> 00:13:26.052
It says she'll be preparing a feast with
the food we brought yesterday.

00:13:26.559 --> 00:13:28.754
But why is the dinner party
being held at the palace archives...

00:13:28.828 --> 00:13:30.796
...instead of Shoka's residence?

00:13:47.948 --> 00:13:49.210
Honestly.

00:13:49.282 --> 00:13:51.614
Why are we having dinner at the
archives instead of at home?

00:13:51.685 --> 00:13:53.619
What's father thinking?

00:13:54.854 --> 00:13:57.448
Perhaps it's so we can have
Senior Secretary Kou...

00:13:57.824 --> 00:14:00.292
...Assistant Secretary Kei and various
other people drop by.

00:14:01.494 --> 00:14:03.962
- I suppose so.
- My Lady.

00:14:04.097 --> 00:14:05.587
What is it? Ah!

00:14:08.301 --> 00:14:11.031
- No wonder I was feeling cold.
- Right.

00:14:11.905 --> 00:14:13.395
It's beautiful.

00:14:13.473 --> 00:14:15.441
Oh, this looks delicious.

00:14:15.742 --> 00:14:19.644
- Oh, Hakumei.
- So you can cook, I see.

00:14:19.980 --> 00:14:22.448
Yes. Have as much as you like.

00:14:22.916 --> 00:14:25.009
- Thanks.
- Oh, my.

00:14:25.151 --> 00:14:27.119
This looks like a
sumptuous feast, doesn't it?

00:14:28.254 --> 00:14:30.222
Welcome, everyone!

00:14:30.523 --> 00:14:32.491
Oh, it looks delicious!

00:14:32.659 --> 00:14:34.251
Did you make this, Shu?

00:14:34.327 --> 00:14:35.055
Yes.

00:14:35.161 --> 00:14:37.129
Wow, you're amazing!

00:14:38.298 --> 00:14:40.232
Lord Koyu and General Ran!

00:14:40.967 --> 00:14:43.458
I'm sorry that I was out yesterday.

00:14:43.837 --> 00:14:46.499
No, I'm sorry for
intruding the way we did.

00:14:47.107 --> 00:14:49.837
Koyu was feeling incredibly remorseful
for what happened last night.

00:14:50.076 --> 00:14:52.044
He was? But I was
really happy.

00:14:52.679 --> 00:14:54.647
When I heard that you
two came to visit...

00:14:55.048 --> 00:14:58.711
...I got nostalgic, and it gave me
a great sense of encouragement!

00:15:02.255 --> 00:15:04.223
Oh my, this bean cake...!

00:15:04.924 --> 00:15:06.858
Advisor Sho and Advisor So!

00:15:06.926 --> 00:15:10.157
- When did you get here?
- Mind if a couple of old men join you?

00:15:10.630 --> 00:15:13.690
Not at all! Now, everyone, please eat!

00:15:14.300 --> 00:15:16.268
Yeah. Let's dig in, then.

00:15:29.582 --> 00:15:31.550
Everyone...

00:15:33.153 --> 00:15:35.121
I wanted to say this sooner...

00:15:35.955 --> 00:15:38.947
I, Shurei Hong have safely
returned from Sa Province.

00:15:43.329 --> 00:15:46.127
Welcome back, Shu! You've
really come a long way.

00:15:46.566 --> 00:15:50.502
It feels like such a long time
ago that you were in training.

00:15:52.806 --> 00:15:57.539
It sure brings back memories.
It all started with this bean cake.

00:15:59.112 --> 00:16:03.481
Shurei entered the palace thanks
to Sho's strong recommendation.

00:16:30.343 --> 00:16:33.244
Well, everyone, please enjoy
the food before it gets cold.

00:16:33.847 --> 00:16:35.747
Here, Seiran, you come
over here, too!

00:16:36.015 --> 00:16:37.983
Don't hold back!

00:16:40.620 --> 00:16:42.588
Everyone is enjoying themselves!

00:16:43.990 --> 00:16:46.458
Why don't you enjoy
yourself too, Brother?

00:16:46.593 --> 00:16:49.357
Now, if you'll excuse me,
I'm going to savor Shurei's cooking.

00:16:52.165 --> 00:16:53.962
Are you going in there too, Brother?

00:16:54.033 --> 00:16:56.934
Well, I'm the one who manages
the archives, after all.

00:16:57.904 --> 00:16:59.895
And just like that,
you all desert me.

00:17:00.273 --> 00:17:02.366
Then why don't you join them too?

00:17:03.409 --> 00:17:05.809
Why must I alone continue watching
over her from the shadows?

00:17:05.945 --> 00:17:10.075
Like I've been telling you, properly
introduce yourself as her uncle.

00:17:10.517 --> 00:17:12.917
Yes... I'm lonely.

00:17:16.756 --> 00:17:18.951
There's someone who's
even lonelier than you.

00:17:22.862 --> 00:17:24.352
He's a man who is
possessed by loneliness...

00:17:24.430 --> 00:17:25.897
...from which he cannot escape.

00:17:27.267 --> 00:17:30.668
The more he behaves like a king,
the lonelier he becomes.

00:17:31.604 --> 00:17:33.697
That's what it means to
be the king, right?

00:17:34.007 --> 00:17:36.305
You're right. But...

00:17:38.978 --> 00:17:41.606
He had a dream that he
wasn't expected to have.

00:17:43.483 --> 00:17:45.542
You're saying that dream is Shurei?

00:17:46.252 --> 00:17:49.312
From now on, as he adds to
his reputation as king...

00:17:49.789 --> 00:17:52.257
...there will be less and less
people who see him as Ryuki.

00:17:53.059 --> 00:17:54.959
And your point is?

00:17:55.028 --> 00:17:56.757
So Shurei is, and will be...

00:17:56.829 --> 00:18:00.196
...the only person who will
continue to call him by his name.

00:18:01.434 --> 00:18:05.461
You were able to find Shurei and
Koyu, as well as Secretary Kou.

00:18:06.639 --> 00:18:08.732
If Seiran had walked the
path to becoming the king...

00:18:08.808 --> 00:18:10.275
...then he wouldn't be
over there, right?

00:18:10.343 --> 00:18:12.368
- He wouldn't have met Ensei.
- What are you standing
here alone for?

00:18:12.445 --> 00:18:15.107
- Now Seiran, eat!
- Right now, Seiran is able to take...

00:18:15.181 --> 00:18:18.014
...everything that he cherishes into his
hands as much as his heart desires.

00:18:19.319 --> 00:18:21.947
However, from now on,
Ryuki will never be able...

00:18:22.255 --> 00:18:24.883
...to obtain anything for himself
for the rest of his life.

00:18:26.292 --> 00:18:30.956
And because he knows that, he
can't let go of the one dream he has.

00:18:32.665 --> 00:18:33.962
This is troublesome.

00:18:34.033 --> 00:18:36.729
Why did Shurei and His Majesty
have to meet each other, I wonder?

00:18:38.037 --> 00:18:40.005
But still, Reishin.

00:18:40.273 --> 00:18:43.800
Fate is a mysterious
yet fascinating thing.

00:18:58.291 --> 00:18:59.588
All right, young man.

00:18:59.659 --> 00:19:02.127
- It's time for a mid-winter swim!
- Why me?!

00:19:04.497 --> 00:19:05.725
- Shurei!
- You too, Koyu!

00:19:05.798 --> 00:19:06.730
- What do you mean?!
- Get going!

00:19:06.799 --> 00:19:08.767
Oh, Father.

00:19:09.435 --> 00:19:12.063
There's a place I'd like you
to deliver bean cakes to.

00:19:24.517 --> 00:19:26.485
There's nobody here.

00:20:03.956 --> 00:20:05.389
Why...?

00:20:05.525 --> 00:20:06.457
Likewise for you.

00:20:07.360 --> 00:20:10.329
I-I come here every night... well...

00:20:11.898 --> 00:20:14.332
...ever since you returned
from Sa Province.

00:20:18.037 --> 00:20:21.529
You know, I accomplished
quite a bit while over there.

00:20:21.941 --> 00:20:24.239
Oh, you know, of course.
You're the king.

00:20:24.711 --> 00:20:26.906
I might've even matured a bit.

00:20:43.062 --> 00:20:44.256
I'm back.

00:20:45.365 --> 00:20:46.832
Ryuki.

00:20:54.173 --> 00:20:56.403
Wha... What's the matter?

00:21:09.122 --> 00:21:11.090
Shurei.

00:21:12.225 --> 00:21:15.558
Shurei... Shurei, Shurei!

00:21:17.764 --> 00:21:20.130
You kept your promise.

00:21:22.001 --> 00:21:24.469
I want you to see me as
me and not as the king.

00:21:27.340 --> 00:21:30.503
In fact, I confess.
I thought about you a lot.

00:21:31.077 --> 00:21:35.343
The more I was away from you,
the more I'd see you as a good king.

00:21:35.815 --> 00:21:37.874
That's all right. That's not important.

00:21:39.852 --> 00:21:43.652
I confess that I was lonely
because you weren't here, Shurei.

00:21:46.893 --> 00:21:48.861
I love you.

00:21:51.731 --> 00:21:53.699
I love you.

00:21:56.335 --> 00:21:58.303
You, and only you, forever.

00:22:16.088 --> 00:22:17.453
Why?

00:22:19.592 --> 00:22:21.389
Don't you 'why' me!!

00:22:21.461 --> 00:22:23.952
- Now, sit down right here!
- R-Right!

00:22:25.064 --> 00:22:28.659
I've had a lot of time to contemplate
life while I was in Sa Province!

00:22:28.734 --> 00:22:29.928
Y-Yeah?

00:22:30.002 --> 00:22:33.199
And I realized that I
have gaps in my defense!

00:22:33.739 --> 00:22:37.505
So I decided from my heart to be
steadfast toward men from now on!

00:22:37.643 --> 00:22:41.238
What?! Well, um... I wouldn't mind
you making an exception in my case.

00:22:41.314 --> 00:22:43.714
And there's one more
thing that I've decided!

00:22:43.783 --> 00:22:46.377
If I learn that someone has feelings
for me, I'll think about it carefully...

00:22:46.452 --> 00:22:49.285
...and then I'll give him an answer
as soon as possible. That's why...!

00:22:53.326 --> 00:22:55.123
There's no hurry.

00:22:57.230 --> 00:22:59.198
I'm not in any hurry.

00:23:00.333 --> 00:23:02.301
I'll be waiting for you. Always.

00:23:03.436 --> 00:23:07.099
No matter how far into the future
it may be or how far away you are.

00:23:07.673 --> 00:23:09.573
That day will surely come.

00:23:09.642 --> 00:23:11.803
My dream remains here.

00:23:13.779 --> 00:23:16.247
Even since the first time
we met each other here.

00:23:23.356 --> 00:23:28.453
You've always led a very carefree
life and right now

00:23:28.594 --> 00:23:35.158
Amidst this rain
what sort of dreams are you chasing?

00:23:35.268 --> 00:23:40.331
And while you are fighting
loneliness somewhere

00:23:40.439 --> 00:23:45.433
You must be holding back
the tears too

00:23:46.512 --> 00:23:50.972
You say you'll be fine alone

00:23:52.518 --> 00:23:57.581
You are just like me

00:23:58.324 --> 00:24:05.059
Even if we have to take
the longer way around

00:24:05.164 --> 00:24:10.227
We somehow still prefer this route

00:24:10.369 --> 00:24:16.638
Whenever I feel happy or glad

00:24:17.009 --> 00:24:22.572
I will always think of you

00:24:23.015 --> 00:24:28.688
I believe that the colorful seasons will
deliver this feeling of mine to you

00:24:28.688 --> 00:24:30.690
I believe that the colorful seasons will
deliver this feeling of mine to you
I won't change.

00:24:30.690 --> 00:24:32.992
I believe that the colorful seasons will
deliver this feeling of mine to you

00:24:32.992 --> 00:24:34.960
I believe that the colorful seasons will
deliver this feeling of mine to you
I know.

00:24:35.795 --> 00:24:38.855
I want to keep walking,
further ahead.

00:24:39.332 --> 00:24:41.357
So things may never change
from how they are now.

00:24:41.867 --> 00:24:42.595
I know.

00:24:43.569 --> 00:24:44.092
Even so?

00:24:45.438 --> 00:24:47.133
Yes.

00:24:53.446 --> 00:24:55.914
Even so, I'll wait forever.
